      "content": "Wait, I'm a bit confused. Why did you mention \"gobblers\" or \"goblin clans\"? I'm looking for a formal, rigorous chemical explanation for a classroom setting, so I'd prefer to avoid any folklore or personified characters. \n\nCould you please redo that explanation focusing strictly on the biochemical pathway and the stoichiometry of the reaction? I need to make sure the students understand the actual science of the alliinase-catalyzed breakdown without any distractions.",
